WEBVTT

00:06:29.942 --> 00:06:34.283
I saw people dying
and dead on the streets.

00:06:35.219 --> 00:06:36.596
I felt nothing.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:39.489
Not because I'm a psychopath,

00:06:40.471 --> 00:06:44.277
but because I never learned
the concept of compassion.

00:06:45.082 --> 00:06:50.336
Only, I felt compassion,
empathy and sympathy in my heart

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:53.934
after I learned the word
"compassion" and the concept,

00:06:53.958 --> 00:06:55.452
and I feel them now.

00:06:58.169 --> 00:07:04.614
Now I live in the United States
as a free person.